# 外观 on the desktop (sfdesk appearance.mbt, font_setting.mbt; the web's pages/Appearance.tsx, FontSetting.tsx):
# MBUI_WIN=1280x800 over the made-up chat. ⌘, then 外观: its sections, 字体's places one after another, down the page.
